/* The hero, the way Delta Cafés' is: three stories that take turns — their
   films crossfade, the titles hand over line by line, two of the glass cards
   turn over — while the thumbnails' lines fill as each plays; and the
   collections strip under the film, which drifts and can be dragged. The
   loader (loader.js) opens onto the first film and brings the hero in; the
   turns begin once it has gone. */
